{"4668620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Open: Taskbar Cafe Idle", "steam_appid": 4668620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4737010], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How About Running a Cafe While You Work?</strong> &quot;Still Open&quot; is an idle management simulation that lives quietly on your taskbar, evolving in the background while you focus on your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=960 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Atmosphere:</strong> The cafe's appearance changes according to your system time. From the first light of morning to the dim glow of midnight, the cafe lives with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Mini-Games:</strong> Take pleasant breaks from routine tasks with 12 different mini-games that can trigger randomly when customers arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/629d29995079ca2f51ba4d2edb5c07c3.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=770 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/629d29995079ca2f51ba4d2edb5c07c3.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/629d29995079ca2f51ba4d2edb5c07c3.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Productivity Tools:</strong> More than just a game! Grow your cafe while organizing your work with the built-in <strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> and <strong>Project Tracking</strong> list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System:</strong> Transform your stand from a small counter into a popular spot with over 60 unique upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/54bb990a5297fd2b4860acf4f0813eaf.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=960 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/54bb990a5297fd2b4860acf4f0813eaf.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/54bb990a5297fd2b4860acf4f0813eaf.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist &amp; Relaxing:</strong> With its non-intrusive design and low system usage, it never disrupts your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How About Running a Cafe While You Work?</strong> &quot;Still Open&quot; is an idle management simulation that lives quietly on your taskbar, evolving in the background while you focus on your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=960 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/84cf2f10bd5377fcb86b9f57e8c7e7b4.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Atmosphere:</strong> The cafe's appearance changes according to your system time. From the first light of morning to the dim glow of midnight, the cafe lives with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.poster.avif?t=1785255789\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.webm?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668620/extras/91a0c2a106bec4b639e1043ad551e47b.mp4?t=1785255789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap